DESCRIPTION:Comedian and actor Drew Lynch captured the hearts of America wi
 th his Golden Buzzer performance on Season 10 of America’s Got Talent\, w
 here he finished in second place. After sustaining a traumatic brain injury
  at age 20\, Drew turned to stand-up comedy as a way to rebuild his confide
 nce and reclaim his quality of life\, developing a signature self-deprecati
 ng style that quickly resonated with audiences.\n\nSince then\, Drew has am
 assed millions of followers across social media and continues to tour world
 wide to sold-out crowds. He released multiple comedy specials\, including A
 nd These Are Jokes and Short King in 2023\, as well as his most recent hour
 -long special\, The Stuttering Comedian. He also expanded his impact throug
 h a widely viewed TEDx Talk “Why curiosity gets you farther than ambition
 ” where he spoke candidly about stuttering\, resilience\, and embracing i
 mperfections\, further inspiring audiences around the world. Today\, Drew c
 ontinues to connect with fans through his stand-up\, digital content\, and 
 live performances.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/d
 rew-lynch-23386/
